WEBVTT

00:00:00.550 --> 00:00:02.259
Welcome to the Holiday Guide.

00:00:02.359 --> 00:00:03.212
I'm Theo.

00:00:03.312 --> 00:00:06.827
You're the one setting the table this year, and I'm here to help you do it your way.

00:00:07.837 --> 00:00:13.735
Vegans Explore has been bringing the Vegan community together since 2016, city by city.

00:00:13.835 --> 00:00:17.163
We know the places cooking near you and the groups doing good.

00:00:17.263 --> 00:00:21.518
This Guide puts all of it in one spot for the holidays, free.

00:00:22.648 --> 00:00:26.077
ThanksLiving is Thanksgiving with a fully plant-based table.

00:00:26.177 --> 00:00:29.685
Same family, same gratitude, nobody harmed.

00:00:29.785 --> 00:00:35.113
On this page you'll find a few easy ideas to make it yours, whether you host or bring one dish.

00:00:35.813 --> 00:00:37.135
Don't want to cook it all?

00:00:37.235 --> 00:00:43.415
Pick your chapter and see which Vegan places are cooking for the holiday, what they're offering, and when to order by.

00:00:43.515 --> 00:00:46.507
Our team checks every menu before it shows.

00:00:46.607 --> 00:00:48.031
Save one to find it again.

00:00:48.131 --> 00:00:49.396
Know a place we missed?

00:00:49.496 --> 00:00:50.951
Tell us, and we'll check it.

00:00:51.956 --> 00:00:53.650
Rather be at someone else's table?

00:00:53.750 --> 00:00:57.631
Find sanctuary dinners, potlucks and Thanksgiving events on our calendar.

00:00:57.731 --> 00:00:58.555
Hosting one?

00:00:58.655 --> 00:01:00.269
Add it, so people can find you.

00:01:01.359 --> 00:01:02.996
Giving is part of the season.

00:01:03.096 --> 00:01:07.933
Here are the nonprofits, rescues and sanctuaries doing the work, in your city and beyond.

00:01:08.033 --> 00:01:10.320
Giving Tuesday is December first.

00:01:11.337 --> 00:01:12.504
Run a Vegan business?

00:01:12.604 --> 00:01:16.647
Send us your holiday menu and we'll feature it here, free for members.

00:01:16.747 --> 00:01:20.290
ThanksLiving menus close at the end of November eighteenth.

00:01:21.367 --> 00:01:22.764
This Guide keeps growing.

00:01:22.864 --> 00:01:27.105
Each holiday opens here as it gets close, so be on the lookout for the next one.

00:01:27.205 --> 00:01:30.497
Come back often, and share it with whoever's at your table this year.

00:01:30.597 --> 00:01:31.832
Happy holidays.
